 "summary": "A single-row, 4-circuit PCB header from the PicoBlade family (series 53047) on a 1.25 mm pitch. It is vertical and fully shrouded, has through-hole tails 2.30 mm long, and locks to its mating part with a friction lock. Maximum current per contact is 1 A and maximum voltage 125 V; durability is 30 mating cycles max and the operating range is -40 to +85 °C.",
