  {
   "topic": "Mating",
   "page": 1,
   "text": "Mates with 51021 PicoBlade wire-to-wire. Friction lock to the mating part; no keying, no guide, no first-mate/last-break. Mated height 5.20 mm."
  },
  {
   "topic": "Board attachment",
   "page": 1,
   "text": "Through-hole tails 2.30 mm long, for a recommended board thickness of 0.80 mm. No PCB locator, no PCB retention feature, not polarized to the board, not surface-mount compatible."
  },
  {
   "topic": "Materials",
   "page": 1,
   "text": "Tin plating on both the mating area and the tails. Flammability rating 94V-0; not glow-wire compliant. Packaging type: tray."
  }
